<title>INDIA: India SEBI meet to discuss stock lend, short sales.</title>
<headline>India SEBI meet to discuss stock lend, short sales.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finance Minister P. Chidambaram said on Friday a forthcoming board meeting of market regulator the Securities and Exchange Board of India (SEBI) would take &quot;many key decisions.&quot;</p>
<p>SEBI is scheduled to meet on November 18.</p>
<p>Chidambaram said SEBI would make announcements on mutual fund regulations, venture capital fund regulations, on stock lending and short selling.</p>
<p>He did not give any further details.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
